WEBVTT

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:02.086
even if you don't actually quit.

00:16:02.431 --> 00:16:03.806
But unlike stress,

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:07.866
burnout doesn't necessarily originate
from the way you react to an event.

00:16:07.890 --> 00:16:10.026
It originates in particular kinds of jobs,

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:11.955
in particular kinds of workplaces.

00:16:11.979 --> 00:16:13.803
(Music)

00:16:13.827 --> 00:16:15.926
Your organization
probably has some practices

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.513
that fuel a culture of burnout.

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:20.456
So it shouldn't be up to you
as an individual

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:21.753
to conquer burnout alone.

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:25.546
Your workplace is often
responsible for the causes,

00:16:25.570 --> 00:16:28.590
so they should take
responsibility for the cures.

00:16:29.650 --> 00:16:31.467
More on that after the break.